{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0273_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0280c0f1f0c859344d968a61fd9406c17a1508a0a88c8702151d30174b62491e", "ja": "（次のライブに向けて、ひなたがレッスンを\n頑張っている。かなり熱心な様子だけど……）", "zh": "（为了下一场演唱会，日向正在努力练习。看起来相当认真，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0273_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "56b9102a9ecb2b58eca601fb87e1e725bc33095a7928f000d6579ffe3a6ac9ef", "ja": "{$P$}……今日のあたし、\nあんまりうまくいってない感じがしないかい？", "zh": "{$P$}……今天的我，是不是感觉不太顺利？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0273_1002_p", "source_sha256": "202baa1126bbea9ff9e1aa955999e69c0de21f32a2b483db1bfe89b935542f45", "ja": "言われてみれば、少し動きが固いような……\nどうかしたのか？", "zh": "你这么说，动作好像是有点僵……\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0273_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "f86a6b04d7a33e519f063cf60780896943b962b81a1149f404831d688fbbf3e6", "ja": "次のライブ、あたしのソロ曲があるでしょや？\nしたっけ、どうしても気合いが入ってしまって。", "zh": "下次演唱会有我的独唱曲，对吧？所以总是不由得太过投入了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0273_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "04e5304fb7168be1658b7dd830470253b81c50088720f208504a9607c78fed29", "ja": "ちょっこし、空回りしてしまってるなぁって、\n自分でもわかってるんだけども……。", "zh": "我也知道自己好像有点使劲过头、反而不得要领了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0273_1005_p", "source_sha256": "fd32d92980a374a7c164c618b4f5a6a8a50d0e017d0c9a7d82b003321fa18a0f", "ja": "そうか……まあ、まだ時間はあるし。\nレッスンを重ねれば、こなれてくると思うぞ。", "zh": "这样啊……不过，时间还多着呢。\n多练习几次，应该就会越来越熟练了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0273_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "28f8b7fbe1cb0bda039bcbcd0abeb7d88a66d4b46b76776b24b43585f7b6d52c", "ja": "そうかねぇ……ううん、頑張るべさ！\nあたし、次はなまら楽しいステージにしたいんだわ。", "zh": "是这样啊……不对，我会努力的！  \n我下次想带来一个特别特别开心的舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0273_1007_035hin", "source_sha256": "61bd642d4cff7f3ed452baca384e55e386289dd0adae0e5c8c118dfb0f633ae4", "ja": "ほら。この間みんなで和太鼓を叩くお仕事を\nしたでしょや？　あの時みたいに。", "zh": "你看，前阵子不是有一次大家一起打和太鼓的工作吗？就像那时候一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0273_1008_p", "source_sha256": "f5fde512f91ea31b596fd313de98d9fcf775978310c8829d7c91d1d5bb1bcf3f", "ja": "ああ、劇場のみんなで、和太鼓を叩いたっけな。\nあれは盛り上がったよな。", "zh": "啊，之前剧场的大家一起打过和太鼓来着。\n那次可真是热闹啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0273_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "56740802bbeb77ab085f60483a53998679fd6aa8efac9fa57aa9ec227310146f", "ja": "うんうん。あんな風に、\nみんなで楽しめたらいいなぁと思うんだけど……。", "zh": "嗯嗯。要是能像那样，大家一起开心就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0273_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "714e451c4c2ec517c722cb3a33adea0f9d68beb4c45539ee3d1143ec29727607", "ja": "そうだ！　ステージで和太鼓を叩いてみるのは、\nどうだろうか？　盛り上がりそうだよぉ。", "zh": "对了！在舞台上试着敲和太鼓，怎么样？感觉会很热闹呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0273_1011_p", "source_sha256": "0c1cfe220976e0cf3cd1a5bce1adf1ac9933c1516e36eb8f60f43d4d9918b880", "ja": "えっ、それはちょっと……いや？\nなんか、意外と合いそうではあるけど。", "zh": "诶，这个嘛……不对？\n不过，感觉意外地还挺合适的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0273_1012_p", "source_sha256": "66b7cf98f711c02efaa1b36417d6c1a73129f0bd421f1e40ea74891df087ce7b", "ja": "でも、やっぱり定期公演に来るお客さんは、\nいつも通りの曲が聞きたいんじゃないかな？", "zh": "不过，定期公演的客人，果然还是想听平时那些歌吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0273_1013_035hin", "source_sha256": "c856e49d1252fa8484cf0ca4cbb3d79acfa495c692a5bc519dd73fd43d985da4", "ja": "そっかぁ。うーん……。", "zh": "这样啊。嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0273_1014_p", "source_sha256": "84e50b24f51aa955b292067a23ae999ddc992b9269aa83db3d8f81e4bb8a05ef", "ja": "難しく考える事はないんじゃないか？　ひなたの曲は\n十分楽しくて、元気になれる曲だと思うよ。", "zh": "没必要想得太复杂吧？日向的歌本身就很有趣，我觉得是能让人打起精神的歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0273_1015_035hin", "source_sha256": "9d065039bb8a510db63fcdcae6675bae3ad17dd8a478a910d2f72b0f6ef7c906", "ja": "あ……うん、そうだよねぇ！\n無理しなくても、曲に合わせたらいいんだべさ。", "zh": "啊……嗯，说得也是呢！  \n不用勉强自己，跟着歌曲来就好了嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0273_1016_035hin", "source_sha256": "cab90928d8fb57141b58f78b0758c462f5667a69617c53ac5a2963d6a9f19c2b", "ja": "あたしが貰った歌は、なまらいい歌だもの。\n歌ってるあたしまで、楽しくて、元気になれるような。", "zh": "我拿到的这首歌，真的是特别棒的歌呢。\n连唱这首歌的我，也会觉得开心，充满活力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0273_1017_p", "source_sha256": "c56ddbe399f309cc9e34cf78ef1e3dd5895ccf5d496d0f25dcf6bbe7f3288961", "ja": "そうだな！　だから、焦る事はないよ。\nのびのびレッスンしていこう。", "zh": "是啊！所以不用着急。\n放松地继续练习吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0273_1018_035hin", "source_sha256": "487007392e1095118d48ae906a67c4f849e168eb3ee342689b8328c993a90651", "ja": "うん！　えへへ……。\nありがとさんです、{$P$}。", "zh": "嗯！嘿嘿……\n谢谢你，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0273_1019_p", "source_sha256": "34c9a3ed8447206b71883dac23a182a97cebe05cff74a9783a49feeb28663d0a", "ja": "（ひなたの表情から、迷いが消えた。\nひなたらしく、楽しいステージにしてくれそうだ）", "zh": "（小日向脸上的迷茫消失了。\n她似乎会用小日向自己的方式，把这场演出变得充满欢乐。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
